# Ice Cauldron exiles two cards over two charges: Dark Ritual for X = 0, then, once that charge is removed, Lightning Bolt for
# X = 1 paid {R}. Its mana is for the last card exiled with it (CR 106.6, 607.2a; the ruling: "the card that was exiled by the
# Cauldron when the most recent charge counter was put there"), so the {R} names the Bolt, not the Ritual exiled first, and
# the Bolt is cast from exile with it.
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Ice Cauldron
Mox Ruby
Dark Ritual
Lightning Bolt
Island
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x26
